<title>UK: World rubber stocks rose in 1996 - IRSG.</title>
<headline>World rubber stocks rose in 1996 - IRSG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>World stocks of natural and synthetic rubber rose in 1996 latest statistics from the International Rubber Study Group showed.</p>
<p>    Data in thousand tonnes -- 1996     1995</p>
<p>Natural production		 6,330    5,990</p>
<p>Natural consumption		6,310    5,920</p>
<p>Natural stocks		     1,600    1,580</p>
<p>Synthetic production	     9,680    9,450</p>
<p>Synthetic consumption	    9,610    9,210</p>
<p>Synthetic stocks		   2,500    2,430</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
